<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending February 8, 1997, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  2-8-97		  319000	    252.7</p>
<p>week ending:  2-1-97		  319000	    251.7</p>
<p>year ago:     2-10-1996	     366000	    248.6</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
